Widget placement gestures
  surfaces/desktop/WidgetSlot.qml adapts the gesture methods of
  ryoku/shell/quickshell/shell/modules/desktop/WidgetSlot.qml from Ryoku
  at f7197d72de8a21e44b0bea922bdd915f28f6b327 (GPLv3).
  Changes: storage writes become signals consumed by Nayori, scale limits
  follow Nayori widget metadata, and rendering stays in Nayori components.
  Theme, wallpaper analysis and spatial effects are outside this controller.

